Line 2: "whose" needs a field after it, but no kind of record has one called "colour".
    say the dogs whose colour is "red".
                       ^^^^^^
Write it like "the dogs whose age is over 3".

Line 3: Something is missing after "are".
    say the scores that are.
                        ^^^
Add a value there, like a number, some text in quotes, or a name.

Line 4: Something is missing after "where".
    say the scores where.
                   ^^^^^
Add a value there, like a number, some text in quotes, or a name.

Line 5: "each" has to start the value, because everything after it is worked out for each item.
    say 1 plus each score in scores.
               ^^^^
Put it in parentheses, like "(each score in scores plus 5)".
